menu "Panel OTA Loader"
    config PANEL_LOADER_ENABLE
        bool "Enable local HTTP OTA loader (trusted LAN only)"
        default n
        help
            Enable the passwordless local firmware upload/configuration UI.
            Any LAN client that can reach this panel can upload application
            firmware, change MQTT settings, or reboot the panel. Enable only
            on a trusted isolated management network; never expose to guests
            or to the internet.
endmenu
